(7564336, 1213218, 12611, '<td valign="top">We talked and talked<br/>and nothing came of it<br/>a change of money<br/>a changing hand of pills<br/>the deal went down, <br/>right outside a Duane Read,<br/>and we laughed at the honesty.<br/> <br/>A jester''s wit, <br/>a soul coffin,<br/>a fat passenger in a dirty van, <br/>stares the face of <br/>America in the eye,<br/>and sticks a needle in <br/>deeper and deeper.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-04-06 04:49:18.</i></td>', 'We talked and talkedand nothing came of ita change of moneya changing hand of pillsthe deal went down, right outside a Duane Read,and we laughed at the honesty. A jester''s wit, a soul coffin,a fat passenger in a dirty van, stares the face of America in the eye,and sticks a needle in deeper and deeper.', '2018-03-30 12:23:08.000000', '2018-04-06 05:49:18.000000', 1),
(7564338, 1213124, 12611, '<td valign="top">shadows, a poem.<br/> <br/>Suburbia awakes in a fury<br/>Cock-eyed and head strong,<br/>and smug in its superiority,<br/>cleaner than it should be, <br/>dirtier than it wants to be.<br/> <br/>The lines intersect<br/>unaware of mortgages<br/>and divorces, and seedy trysts<br/>in late model sedans and love<br/>cleaner than it should be, <br/>dirtier than it wants to be.<br/> <br/>And all the while, <br/>the day in and day out<br/>the sturm und drang<br/>plays it self out<br/>cleaner than it should be, <br/>dirtier than it wants to be,<br/>in the shadows.</td>', 'shadows, a poem. Suburbia awakes in a furyCock-eyed and head strong,and smug in its superiority,cleaner than it should be, dirtier than it wants to be. The lines intersectunaware of mortgagesand divorces, and seedy trystsin late model sedans and lovecleaner than it should be, dirtier than it wants to be. And all the while, the day in and day outthe sturm und drangplays it self outcleaner than it should be, dirtier than it wants to be,in the shadows.', '2018-03-30 12:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
