(7564341, 1213360, 12611, '<td valign="top">Go, a love poem.<br/> <br/>"You don''t smile when you see me any more,"<br/>she said laughing, that turned to a cough.<br/>And he nodded, with tears welling up.<br/> <br/>"You don''t kiss me anymore when we meet,"<br/>she repeated this phrase...<br/>He looked out the window.<br/> <br/>"You don''t stay with me as long as you used to,"<br/>she sputtered, and her tone got serious.<br/>he thought of excuses and then cried, "I''m here now!"<br/> <br/>"You need to leave- the sun is shining, and the day is new,"<br/>She said these words clearly and with empathy.<br/>He shook his head in a futile protest.<br/> <br/>"Go," she said.<br/>And with that,  he stood up, and left the cemetery,<br/>the grieving was over, the memories remained.</td>', 'Go, a love poem. "You don''t smile when you see me any more,"she said laughing, that turned to a cough.And he nodded, with tears welling up. "You don''t kiss me anymore when we meet,"she repeated this phrase...He looked out the window. "You don''t stay with me as long as you used to,"she sputtered, and her tone got serious.he thought of excuses and then cried, "I''m here now!" "You need to leave- the sun is shining, and the day is new,"She said these words clearly and with empathy.He shook his head in a futile protest. "Go," she said.And with that,  he stood up, and left the cemetery,the grieving was over, the memories remained.', '2018-03-30 12:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7564343, 1213248, 12611, '<td valign="top">All things must pass.<br/>She new it was true.<br/>Time marches on.<br/>The cliche was earnest.<br/>There is no going back,<br/>no rewinding the clock, <br/>no return to ways of yore, <br/>the cat was out of the bag, <br/>the curiosity sated, <br/>the glorious future arrived <br/>men were like children<br/>the lady wore trousers.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-04-06 04:35:36.</i></td>', 'All things must pass.She new it was true.Time marches on.The cliche was earnest.There is no going back,no rewinding the clock, no return to ways of yore, the cat was out of the bag, the curiosity sated, the glorious future arrived men were like childrenthe lady wore trousers.', '2018-03-30 13:02:13.000000', '2018-04-06 05:35:36.000000', 1),
