(7564740, 1213365, 12611, '<td valign="top">what will we remember? a poem.<br/> <br/>As the years go past, <br/>and you reminisce, <br/>of the first day of school,<br/>or first person you kissed, <br/>and your memory fades, <br/>of your wee younger times, <br/>with small messy faces<br/>and small schoolyard rhymes, <br/>will you picture me there, <br/>though you can''t sketch my face<br/>on your mind''s drawing board, <br/>in your deepest safe place?<br/>will you cry out at night <br/>when your soul cannot rest,<br/>when you cannot recall,<br/>the times I consider best?</td>', 'what will we remember? a poem. As the years go past, and you reminisce, of the first day of school,or first person you kissed, and your memory fades, of your wee younger times, with small messy facesand small schoolyard rhymes, will you picture me there, though you can''t sketch my faceon your mind''s drawing board, in your deepest safe place?will you cry out at night when your soul cannot rest,when you cannot recall,the times I consider best?', '2018-04-03 11:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
