(7565018, 1213264, 102278, '<td valign="top">There were a lot of leaflets left outside the church<br/>''Let there be light'' they said<br/>Davey wanted to take them down to the viaduct<br/>Start a big fire, burn them<br/>George got a bit upset by that <br/>His mum was big in the Baptist church<br/>Do you want to go and post them then?<br/>Davey said, post them round the estate?<br/>George wasn''t into that at all<br/>So in the end we dumped them in the river.</td>', 'There were a lot of leaflets left outside the church''Let there be light'' they saidDavey wanted to take them down to the viaductStart a big fire, burn themGeorge got a bit upset by that His mum was big in the Baptist churchDo you want to go and post them then?Davey said, post them round the estate?George wasn''t into that at allSo in the end we dumped them in the river.', '2018-04-05 20:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
