(7565127, 1213143, 80096, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the wonderful poems and prose, so thoughtfully created. These hemp dogbane or Indian Hemp seeds were buried beneath the milkweed patch I love to visit and photograph during the autumn months. We''ve had a lot of nor''easters with heavy snowfall this past winter so I was surprised to find these seeds with the white hairs still intact. Hence, the title.</td>', 'Thank you for all the wonderful poems and prose, so thoughtfully created. These hemp dogbane or Indian Hemp seeds were buried beneath the milkweed patch I love to visit and photograph during the autumn months. We''ve had a lot of nor''easters with heavy snowfall this past winter so I was surprised to find these seeds with the white hairs still intact. Hence, the title.', '2018-04-06 17:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7565171, 1213295, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nam:</b></div><hr/><i>Editing to clarify: by "didn''t count", I meant that I hadn''t gone through all the entries counting the number of poems written about each entry. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>English is such a treacherous language... a poet''s language...</td>', 'Originally posted by nam:Editing to clarify: by "didn''t count", I meant that I hadn''t gone through all the entries counting the number of poems written about each entry.   English is such a treacherous language... a poet''s language...', '2018-04-07 13:06:07.000000', NULL, 0),
